#
# ADORE secrets template. Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in.
# Non-secret settings belong in config.toml, never here.

# --- Git platform ------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional when glab/gh are already authenticated on the host (ADORE rides the
# CLI auth). Required for direct API calls or running the CLI in the container.
# GitLab: PAT with `api` scope, Developer role (cannot merge protected branches).
#GITLAB_TOKEN=
# GitHub: fine-grained PAT (Contents + Pull requests + Issues read/write).
#GITHUB_TOKEN=

# --- Executor model provider ---------------------------------------------------
# The key(s) for the executor's configured provider; injected into the
# container at `docker run` time only. Never baked into the image.
#ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
#OPENAI_API_KEY=
